{"data": [{"broadcast_id": "XW2TNCcNLh", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-12", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762155, "segment_id": "yom1xwe2t2", "segment_broadcast_id": "XW2TNCcNLh", "segment_title": "Preview/Introduction Scott Pelley (New York)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 50, "segment_type_id": 1, "segment_start_time": "63000.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762155, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Preview", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "XW2TNCcNLh", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-12", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762155, "segment_id": "D3CA82kUuL", "segment_broadcast_id": "XW2TNCcNLh", "segment_title": "New Jersey / McGreevey Resignation", "segment_description": "(Studio: Scott Pelley) Report introduced. \n (Studio: Randall Pinkston) The resignation of New Jersey Governor James McGreevey after acknowledging an illicit affair with another man featured; photo shown of former aide Golan Cipel&#134;&#134;, who is planning to file a sexual harassment lawsuit. [McGREEVEY \u2013 says \u201cI am a gay American\u201d; comments on removing threats of false allegations & rumors from the Governor\u2019s office; describes his struggle with his sexuality.] The sexual scandals involving former Illinois senate candidate Jack Ryan and former Oregon Governor Neil Goldschmidt&#134;&#134; mentioned.", "segment_duration": 150, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762156, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "XW2TNCcNLh", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-12", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762155, "segment_id": "8hulWgWZe8", "segment_broadcast_id": "XW2TNCcNLh", "segment_title": "California / Same-Sex Marriage", "segment_description": "(Studio: Scott Pelley) The California supreme court\u2019s nullification of gay marriages performed in San Francisco earlier this year reported.", "segment_duration": 30, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63200.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762157, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "XW2TNCcNLh", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-12", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762155, "segment_id": "hKC13D5FxU", "segment_broadcast_id": "XW2TNCcNLh", "segment_title": "Weather Watch (Hurricane Charley)", "segment_description": "(Studio: Scott Pelley) The double threat for Florida of Tropical Storm Bonnie, which hit the Panhandle today, & Hurricane Charley, which is moving toward the Keys, noted; map shown. \n (Carrabelle, Florida: Jim Acosta) Preparations for Charley featured; scenes shown of people evacuating, boarding up buildings & playing on the beach; animated map shown. [2 RESIDENTS, boater Scott DAGGETT&#134;\u2013 react.] [Pinellas County Emergency Management director Gary VICKERS&#134;- advises people to leave.] [Governor Jeb BUSH, National Hurricane Center director Max MAYFIELD&#134;, Florida Fish & Wildlife Commission Jason NEWLIN&#134;- comment on the serious of the storm.] Previous Hurricanes Floyd {1999} & Donna {1960} mentioned.", "segment_duration": 160, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63230.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762158, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "XW2TNCcNLh", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-12", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762155, "segment_id": "p4O4I7kdru", "segment_broadcast_id": "XW2TNCcNLh", "segment_title": "Iraq / Al-Sadr Revolt", "segment_description": "(Studio: Scott Pelley) Report introduced.   (Baghdad: Kimberly Dozier) The US military\u2019s final assault aimed at crushing militias led by radical Shiite cleric Muqtada al-Sadr in Najaf, Iraq, featured; scenes shown from Najaf, where bombs exploded near al-Sadr\u2019s house, and fighting in Kut and Baghdad; details given of the participation of foreign fighters in the militias, including Iranians; video shown of Mahdi militiamen firing a mortar from Najaf\u2019s holy shrine. [Voice of US Marines Maj. David HOLAHAN&#134;- says our problem is the armed militiamen.] [Voice of Lt. Col. MIYAMASU&#134;- comments on the increased difficulty in facing the foreign fighters.]", "segment_duration": 140, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63390.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762159, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "XW2TNCcNLh", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-12", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762155, "segment_id": "CIhjO52YU4", "segment_broadcast_id": "XW2TNCcNLh", "segment_title": "Campaign 04 / Bush vs. Kerry / War on Terror", "segment_description": "(Studio: Scott Pelley) Report introduced.   (Los Angeles: Jim Axelrod) Vice President Dick Cheney\u2019s portrayal of Senator John Kerry as soft on terrorism featured. [In California, KERRY \u2013 speaks on tax cuts; says it\u2019s sad they have nothing to say about the future vision of America.] [CHENEY, wife Lynne CHENEY \u2013 criticize Kerry\u2019s statements about conducting a \u201csensitive\u201d war on terror.] [August 6, KERRY, President BUSH \u2013 use the word \u201csensitive.\u201d]", "segment_duration": 140, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63530.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762160, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "XW2TNCcNLh", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-12", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762155, "segment_id": "i1ItpULR1e", "segment_broadcast_id": "XW2TNCcNLh", "segment_title": "Market Watch: IBM, Oil Prices, Stocks", "segment_description": "(Studio: Scott Pelley) The addition of new jobs at IBM and the price of crude oil noted; Stock Market Report.", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63670.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762161, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "XW2TNCcNLh", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-12", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762155, "segment_id": "7m2TUU5K3N", "segment_broadcast_id": "XW2TNCcNLh", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items; fallen hero Army Command Sgt. Maj. Edward Barnhill&#134<!-- spelling on screen --> profiled. (Studio: Scott Pelley)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 50, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63690.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762162, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "XW2TNCcNLh", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-12", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762155, "segment_id": "hVnA0VNT8k", "segment_broadcast_id": "XW2TNCcNLh", "segment_title": "(Commercial: Fidelity Investments; Allegra; Detrol; Levitra; American Egg Board; Ace Hardware; Poligrip.)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 160, "segment_type_id": 3, "segment_start_time": "63740.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762163, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Commercial", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "XW2TNCcNLh", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-12", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762155, "segment_id": "FYyWniRe0D", "segment_broadcast_id": "XW2TNCcNLh", "segment_title": "Inside Story (Olympics / Drug Testing)", "segment_description": "(Studio: Scott Pelley) The possible suspension from the Olympics of a Greek sprinter for missing a scheduled drug test noted. \n (Athens: Lee Cowan) Testing for illegal drugs at the Olympics featured; details given of a new test for a previously undetectable drug, human growth hormone, and of the implications for the US track team, including Torri Edwards, who was suspended for taking a banned stimulant, and Marion Jones, who is under suspicion; the development of new tests for drugs since the 1968 Olympics outlined. [World Anti-Doping Agency president Dick POUND&#134;- says the likelihood of getting caught is increasing every day.] [JONES \u2013 denies using performance-enhancing drugs.] \n (Studio: Scott Pelley) The Iraq men\u2019s soccer team\u2019s victory over Portugal reported.", "segment_duration": 160, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63900.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762164, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "XW2TNCcNLh", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-12", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762155, "segment_id": "QcqY7h1Wjg", "segment_broadcast_id": "XW2TNCcNLh", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Studio: Scott Pelley)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 10, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64060.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762165, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News"